      "comment": "CINTA'S ME MUM (1) had to overcome a check in the run but could manage only a distant third (23.89) in a TG1-4W over 400m at this track. Given another chance. BOURNE REAGAN (2) struggled in tougher grade last start at this track, but prior to that won by 1.3 lengths at this track (23.60) beating Lektra Lee in a TG1-4W on October 1. Should be in this for a long way. MOONLIGHT HAZE (4) broke through for his maiden success two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished fourth and beaten 7 lengths at this track over 305m (17.92). Expecting significant improvement this line-up. APPELLANT (5) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
